### Railway Cron / external scheduler
### Schedule: every hour
### Method: POST
### URL: https://YOUR-API.up.railway.app/api/internal/cron/reminders
### Header: x-cron-secret: ${{CRON_SECRET}}

POST https://YOUR-API.up.railway.app/api/internal/cron/reminders
x-cron-secret: replace-with-CRON_SECRET
Content-Type: application/json
